---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import founder from '../assets/founder.png';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import RailSection from '../components/RailSection.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="About | Struc"
  description="Struc is a data consultancy founded by Priscilla Fung, helping purpose-driven organisations build practical, sustainable data systems."
  rail
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="About"
    title="Practical data help for organisations with a purpose"
    lead="Struc is a data consultancy for charities, social enterprises and growing businesses. We turn scattered, underused data into something you can rely on when making decisions."
  />

  <div class="container">
    <RailSection title="Why Struc exists">
      <Prose>
        <p>
          Many organisations collect valuable data but struggle to turn it into reliable
          information. It sits in spreadsheets, third-party systems and sometimes on paper. Much of
          the advice available assumes a data team and infrastructure that smaller organisations
          don't have.
        </p>
        <p>
          Struc was founded in 2023 to close that gap. We bring the rigour of large technical
          organisations and size it for the team you have.
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </RailSection>

    <RailSection title="How we think">
      <ul class="grid grid-2 principles">
        <li class="card">
          <strong>Understand first.</strong> On anything complex we start with discovery. Building
          before the problem is understood usually means building twice.
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <strong>The simplest thing that lasts.</strong> We ask what the simplest robust solution is
          for your organisation and build that, not the most sophisticated thing that is technically
          possible.
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <strong>Built to hand over.</strong> Training and documentation are part of the work. The
          aim is that your team can run it without us.
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <strong>Plain language.</strong> We work with leaders and front-line staff alike, and
          explain things in terms of what you need to achieve.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </RailSection>

    <RailSection title="Priscilla Fung, founder">
      <div class="founder">
        <Image
          src={founder}
          alt={site.founder.name}
          width={200}
          height={200}
          densities={[1, 2]}
          quality={80}
        />
        <Prose>
          <p>
            Priscilla is a data consultant with ten years' experience across analytics, data science
            and data systems.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before founding Struc she worked in large-scale technology environments, including
            robotics and e-commerce, supporting operational systems across multiple sites and
            countries. She led the development of data models and dashboards used by hundreds of
            people in seven countries. That work shaped her practical approach: paying attention not
            only to how systems are designed, but to how they work day to day.
          </p>
          <p>
            She founded Struc to help purpose-driven organisations make better use of their data,
            from improving data quality and processes to building measurement frameworks, dashboards
            and automated systems.
          </p>
          <p><a href={site.founder.linkedIn} rel="noopener">Connect on LinkedIn</a></p>
        </Prose>
      </div>
    </RailSection>

    <RailSection title="Experience">
      <Prose>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Data systems and automation.</strong> Databases, end-to-end pipelines, system
            integrations and workflow automation.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics and data science.</strong> Statistical analysis of quantitative and
            qualitative data to measure impact and support decisions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Data quality and reporting.</strong> Data audits, cleaning, governance,
            dashboards and reporting.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Impact measurement.</strong> Monitoring and evaluation, survey design, funder
            reporting and data for carbon projects.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Training.</strong> Sessions for people at every level of experience with data.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="tools">
          Python, SQL, dbt, Power BI, Tableau, Looker Studio, Microsoft Fabric, Google Sheets and
          Excel.
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </RailSection>

    <RailSection title="Working with partners and funders">
      <Prose>
        <p>
          We also work alongside IT companies and funders. For IT companies, we scope data needs and
          translate business requirements into technical specifications. For funders who want to
          build capability in the organisations they support, we help shape data projects so that
          time and money are used well.
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </RailSection>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .principles {
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .founder {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .founder img {
    flex: none;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .tools {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 859px) {
    .founder {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .founder img {
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
